{"schema": "2.0", "config": {"update_multi": true}, "header": {"title": {"tag": "plain_text", "content": "托管结束｜还等你 1 件"}, "subtitle": {"tag": "plain_text", "content": "11-21 12:00 开始｜16:45 结束"}, "template": "grey"}, "body": {"elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='red'>**还等你 1 件**</font>　往下找红字。每件开头的圆圈数字是它的编号，按冒出来的先后编，回话时带上编号就行。"}, {"tag": "hr"}, {"tag": "column_set", "flex_mode": "none", "horizontal_spacing": "8px", "columns": [{"tag": "column", "width": "48px", "vertical_align": "top", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>12:00</font>"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "weighted", "weight": 1, "vertical_align": "top", "vertical_spacing": "4px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "▶ 托管开始"}]}]}, {"tag": "column_set", "flex_mode": "none", "horizontal_spacing": "8px", "columns": [{"tag": "column", "width": "48px", "vertical_align": "top", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>12:10</font>"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "weighted", "weight": 1, "vertical_align": "top", "vertical_spacing": "4px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>✅ **磁盘瘦身**｜装好了。</font>"}]}]}, {"tag": "column_set", "flex_mode": "none", "horizontal_spacing": "8px", "columns": [{"tag": "column", "width": "48px", "vertical_align": "top", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>12:40</font>"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "weighted", "weight": 1, "vertical_align": "top", "vertical_spacing": "4px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>✅ **数字分身**｜跑完了，没问题。</font>"}]}]}, {"tag": "column_set", "flex_mode": "none", "horizontal_spacing": "8px", "columns": [{"tag": "column", "width": "48px", "vertical_align": "top", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>12:42</font>"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "weighted", "weight": 1, "vertical_align": "top", "vertical_spacing": "4px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'